# Copy this file to .env (it is git-ignored) and fill in your key. Never commit .env or paste the key into chat.
#
# NASA FIRMS MAP_KEY, used only by scripts/refresh-hotspots.ts (and the deploy workflow, as a GitHub secret).
# Get a free key at https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/map_key/ (it is emailed to you).
# The limit is 5000 requests per 10 minutes, which one refresh uses a tiny part of.
# On GitHub, store the same value as the Actions secret FIRMS_MAP_KEY:
#   gh secret set FIRMS_MAP_KEY        (prompts for the value, hidden)
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=
